       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. COMPSIZES.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 DISP-NUM  PIC 9(9) VALUE 123456789.
       01 COMP-NUM  PIC 9(9) COMP VALUE 123456789.
       01 COMP3-NUM PIC 9(9) COMP-3 VALUE 123456789.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           DISPLAY "DISPLAY bytes: " LENGTH OF DISP-NUM
           DISPLAY "COMP bytes:    " LENGTH OF COMP-NUM
           DISPLAY "COMP-3 bytes:  " LENGTH OF COMP3-NUM
           DISPLAY COMP-NUM " " COMP3-NUM
           STOP RUN.
